        "desc": "<p>导示长风的标鹄。风的牧歌并不总是轻柔如初…</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/10/08/47826599/98f3fb9e0886b25bfd094828cc391978_4901953143942170202.png",
